{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bright white light, the hero wakes up and sees a crystal in front of him, he realises he must find the others, and restore the greatness of his settlement! Where are all the people? He takes a simple sword and goes to the nearest island in search of the people...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FROM NOTHING TO SOMETHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From one almost forgotten to a thriving kingdom, build greatness with your allies. Use building tools to create the perfect stronghold. Construct, furnish and decorate your new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191740/extras/building.gif?t=1743780789\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CREATE YOUR DESTINY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore your randomly-generated islands. Find treasures, equipment, survivors. Fight with evil and create a better future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191740/extras/destiny.gif?t=1743780789\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVE RAIDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build unbreakable defenses and set traps against unrelenting waves of enemies. Arm your settlers and command them in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191740/extras/defence.gif?t=1743780789\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Now lands is free!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191740/65a210e8e510aae32df8351289c2a20b21d13f27.jpg"},{"name":"Village is growing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191740/3b41e2047aab678bbca7b219ff2c23b37b93a393.jpg"},{"name":"Village is growing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191740/0e